{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination\/googleAnalytics(measurementID:apiSecret:region:plan:transport:backoff:clock:now:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination on a server that sends batches to the Google Analytics web or data stream of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"measurementID"},{"type":"text","text":", authenticated by its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"apiSecret"},{"type":"text","text":", through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transport"},{"type":"text","text":", retrying a send that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fails for now with the waits of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"backoff"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clock"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"googleAnalytics","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"measurementID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"apiSecret","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"region","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsRegion","text":"GoogleAnalyticsRegion","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:23GoogleAnalyticsEncoding0aB6RegionO"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"plan","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transport","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Transport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"backoff","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/ExponentialBackoff","text":"ExponentialBackoff","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations18ExponentialBackoffV"},{"text":" = ExponentialBackoff(), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clock","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Clock","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"text":"> = ContinuousClock(), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"now","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"text":" = { Date.now }) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError","text":"GoogleAnalyticsSetupError","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:23GoogleAnalyticsEncoding0aB10SetupErrorO"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination","text":"HTTPDestination","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations15HTTPDestinationV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Transport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsBatchEncoder","text":"GoogleAnalyticsBatchEncoder","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:23GoogleAnalyticsEncoding0aB12BatchEncoderV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The web or data stream’s measurement ID, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"G-"},{"type":"text","text":" followed by letters and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"digits, from the stream’s details in Google Analytics’ Admin. Whitespace and newlines"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"around it are trimmed off."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"measurementID"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An API secret of the stream, from its Measurement Protocol API secrets in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Google Analytics’ Admin. Whitespace and newlines around it are trimmed off.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"apiSecret"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where Google collects the data: "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsRegion\/global","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", its default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"endpoint, or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsRegion\/eu","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"region"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracking plan of every event the destination is given."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"plan"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What sends each request.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"transport"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"How long to wait before each new attempt at a request; 1 second, doubling up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to 60 seconds, with full jitter, by default."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"backoff"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The clock the waits are measured on."}]}],"name":"clock"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The wall-clock time a batch is encoded at, and each request’s deadline is checked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against before it is sent; the system’s clock by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"now"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The destination.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The destination posts to the Measurement Protocol’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/mp\/collect","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" endpoint of ","type":"text"},{"code":"region","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the measurement ID and API secret in its query, encoded by a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsBatchEncoder"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of ","type":"text"},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" within ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsBatchEncoder\/batchLimit"},{"text":" that leaves out each record","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracked more than 71 hours before, or more than 15 minutes after, the time ","type":"text"},{"code":"now","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" gives as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"batch is encoded: Google Analytics takes 72, and the hour to spare is for the request to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reach Google and clocks that disagree. It sends no trace context in its header fields. It","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retries no response, a 5xx, 408 or 429, and drops and reports any other status. A request","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still undelivered 71 hours after its oldest record was tracked, by the time ","type":"text"},{"code":"now","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" gives,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isn’t sent again: the whole request is dropped, its younger records too, and reported as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDropReport.deadlineExceeded(deadline:recordIDs:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as Google Analytics would store its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"oldest records as 72 hours old. The Measurement Protocol answers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"2xx to every request it receives, so a wrong measurement ID or API secret, or a request it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can’t read, is answered 2xx with nothing stored: check the property’s Realtime report after","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"setting it up.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The API secret lets anyone holding it send events to the property, so this factory is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for a server, and must never be given a secret in an app. It is compiled for macOS and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Linux alone, so an app for iOS, iPadOS, tvOS, watchOS, visionOS or Mac Catalyst that calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it fails to compile. A Mac app (AppKit or SwiftUI) compiles it, but the factory refuses it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at run time: it throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/appBundle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when the main bundle is an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".app"},{"type":"text","text":" or an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".appex"},{"type":"text","text":". To get an app’s events here, send them to a server of yours that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes this destination; see the module’s article for what that server does."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The secret is in the query of every request’s URL, so don’t log the destination, its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requests or a transport’s URLs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The encoder logs a notice for each event and property of "},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" named as Google Analytics"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses, or keeps for itself, as every record of that event will be skipped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsEncodingError","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/appBundle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in an app or an app extension,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/emptyMeasurementID","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a measurement ID that is empty or only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whitespace, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/malformedMeasurementID","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for one that isn’t "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"G-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"followed by uppercase ASCII letters and digits, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/emptyAPISecret","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a secret that is empty or only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whitespace."}]}]}]}],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"HTTPDestination+GoogleAnalytics.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/HTTPDestination+GoogleAnalytics.swift#L70"},"extendedModule":"HTTPDestinations","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["HTTPDestinations"],"name":"GoogleAnalyticsEncoding"}],"externalID":"s:16HTTPDestinations15HTTPDestinationV23GoogleAnalyticsEncodingAD0cD12BatchEncoderVRs_rlE06googleD013measurementID9apiSecret6region4plan9transport7backoff5clock3nowACyxAFGSS_SSAD0cD6RegionO13TrackingPlans0T4PlanVxAA18ExponentialBackoffVqd__20FoundationEssentials4DateVyYbctAD0cD10SetupErrorOYK12_Concurrency5ClockRd__s8DurationVA3_Rtd__lFZ","symbolKind":"method","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Transport"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPTransport"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encoding"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GoogleAnalyticsBatchEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"title":"googleAnalytics(measurementID:apiSecret:region:plan:transport:backoff:clock:now:)","fragments":[{"